"The arena in 3D: animated gladiators wearing their real gear, beasts, the crowd and the main menu show, with each arena in its own stone":"A arena em 3D: gladiadores animados com seu equipamento real, feras, a plateia e o show do menu principal, cada arena com sua própria pedra",
